  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Boil the kettle.\n• Chop cauliflower into small florets. Roughly chop carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place cauliflower and carrot on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle over mild North Indian spice blend, drizzle with olive oil and season with a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227820c48c491a110e73b5/step-0aa6e2cc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are roasting, in a medium heatproof bowl, add couscous and vegetable stock powder and half the butter.\n• Add the boiling water (3/4 cup for 2 people / 11/2 cups for 4 people) and stir to combine. Immediately cover with plate and leave for 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with fork and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227820c48c491a110e73b5/step-49d6dcc9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While couscous is cooking, slice lemon into wedges. Roughly chop silverbeet.\n• In a small bowl, combine Greek-Style yoghurt, a generous squeeze of lemon juice and a pinch of salt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227820c48c491a110e73b5/step-4c21f0b6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook ginger paste and Mumbai spice blend until fragrant, 30 seconds.\n• Stir in diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, the honey and remaining butter and cook until thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227820c48c491a110e73b5/step-dcef55e2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add silverbeet to Mumbai spice sauce and cook, strring, until just wilted, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste. TIP: Add a splash of water if the sauce looks too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227820c48c491a110e73b5/step-e00dc110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide couscous between bowls. Spoon over Mumbai spice sauce.\n• Top with Indian-spiced cauliflower and carrot. Spinkle with roasted cashews.\n• Spoon over lemon yoghurt. Tear over coriander.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/64227820c48c491a110e73b5/step-e7b74bbb.jpg"
    }
  ]
